1
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:44,020
[Small Town Remedy]

2
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:46,800
[Episode 28]

3
00:01:46,979 --> 00:01:47,759
[To spend the rest of my life
in the name of love]

4
00:01:47,789 --> 00:01:49,660
[Joy Comes to Our Home]
[Mr. Jia Xin and Ms. Gong Xue]

5
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:51,920
[Happy]

6
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:55,270
[Wedding Banquet]

7
00:01:55,270 --> 00:01:58,750
[Joy Comes to Our Home]
[Jia Xin, Gong Xue]

8
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:02,950
[Happy]

9
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,800
How can I help you two?

10
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,590
No need.

11
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,560
Sir, your seat is over there.

12
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:15,400
Okay.

13
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,400
Director Duan.

14
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:17,910
This way, please.

15
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:19,000
Are you happy today?

16
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,280
Very happy!

17
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,870
Enjoy your meal.

18
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:31,520
Take your seat.

19
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,150
Auntie Duan.

20
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,710
Congratulations! Congratulations!

21
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,960
It's so festive today.

22
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,470
Xue bought it for me!

23
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,560
Does it look good?

24
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,290
Such a good daughter-in-law.

25
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:43,200
You two came quite fast.

26
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,520
Memorizing your lines?

27
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:56,560
You won't drop the ball later, will you?

28
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,150
What do you mean by that?

29
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,280
I've seen it all.

30
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:03,310
I promise I won't embarrass you.

31
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:04,710
You can't embarrass me,

32
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:06,310
and you have to make me proud.

33
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,470
Later, for the young couple,

34
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:09,730
you have to get things off
to a good start.

35
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,870
Rest assured.

36
00:03:12,190 --> 00:03:13,800
I will definitely complete the task.

37
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,560
You have to.

38
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,820
We're counting on you.

39
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,560
Going up?

40
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:25,430
Great.

41
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:34,150
Great!

42
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,240
Distinguished guests,

43
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,750
friends,

44
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,400
welcome!

45
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,430
-Great!
-Great!

46
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,870
Today

47
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:58,590
is Jia Xin and Gong Xue's big day.

48
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,360
We are here

49
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,430
to witness the happy moment

50
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,680
of the newlyweds!

51
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,680
Great!

52
00:04:08,190 --> 00:04:08,910
The groom.

53
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,829
Well.

54
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,310
Now, please...

55
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:22,920
Please welcome the bride to the stage.

56
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,240
So beautiful!

57
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:31,720
-Great!
-Great!

58
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,040
-Great!
-Great!

59
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:47,240
Dad.

60
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,680
Leave Xue to me.

61
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,880
You can rest assured.

62
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:52,630
Good.

63
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:56,390
Xue, hold the flowers.

64
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:58,390
My child.

65
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:03,950
Very good.

66
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:05,720
-Great!
-Great!

67
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,520
So beautiful.

68
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,240
What did they say? Speak louder!

69
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,160
I didn't hear it!

70
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,040
So beautiful!

71
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:21,550
P-Please have the flower girl
bring the rings.

72
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:30,040
The ring is a token of love
and commitment.

73
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:32,240
It's the devotion of two hearts.

74
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:34,159
It represents responsibility

75
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:36,190
and cherishment.

76
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,800
Please exchange the rings.

77
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:42,240
Keep this commitment

78
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,630
firmly on each other's fingertips,

79
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:46,880
and carve it into each other's hearts.

80
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:49,000
From now on, the left hand...

81
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,920
The left hand holds you,

82
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,750
and the right hand holds
the rest of your life.

83
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,000
In the name of love,

84
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,750
stay together for a lifetime.

85
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:59,270
May you hold each other's hands,

86
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:00,630
grow old together,

87
00:06:00,870 --> 00:06:02,430
and be united forever.

88
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:04,240
Well said!

89
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:04,800
Great!

90
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,600
Great!

91
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,310
Next, let's welcome

92
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:15,120
the groom's mother.

93
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,120
Coming!

94
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,360
Come on, Auntie Duan!

95
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,430
Coming!

96
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,270
Hello, everyone. I'm Duan,

97
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:32,150
Jia Xin's mother.

98
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:36,270
Thank you all for coming!

99
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:37,310
Thank you!

100
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,430
Many of my old colleagues

101
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:41,920
are here today.

102
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,600
I haven't seen you in years.

103
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:45,920
I'll definitely have a good chat

104
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,000
with you all later.

105
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:51,310
I want to take this opportunity

106
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:53,240
to thank my son, Jia Xin.

107
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,830
Since he was a kid,

108
00:06:55,830 --> 00:06:58,800
he's been very honest.

109
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:01,360
For so many years,

110
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,040
I've been single-mindedly trying

111
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,390
to get an explanation.

112
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,600
He just followed me around

113
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,190
every day,

114
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,070
running here and there.

115
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,240
Actually, many people

116
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,510
looked down on us.

117
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,360
He

118
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:19,240
never complained once,

119
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,480
not a single word.

120
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:23,200
He just went along with whatever I wanted.

121
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,430
Actually, I know

122
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:28,600
he wanted me to move on.

123
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,920
But I just couldn't let it go.

124
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:34,000
I always felt that in life,

125
00:07:34,830 --> 00:07:36,230
no matter what happened,

126
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,430
there must be justice.

127
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,040
But I didn't expect

128
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,120
that the justice I chased for 20 years

129
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:44,360
would finally

130
00:07:44,830 --> 00:07:47,800
be found in my son.

131
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,510
I've figured it out.

132
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:55,070
People have to keep up with the times.

133
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,270
No matter how you live,

134
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:59,870
you have to move forward and look ahead.

135
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:02,310
Just like my kidney stone,

136
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,950
it can't stay stuck there forever.

137
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:07,360
Either it comes out on its own,

138
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,750
or you find someone to get it out.

139
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:13,430
No matter where it was stuck before,

140
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:16,630
as long as it can come out,
it's not too late!

141
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,270
-Right!
-Right!

142
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:23,600
Now, my son has found

143
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,680
someone he can spend

144
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
the rest of his life with, Xue.

145
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:31,240
He has his own family now.

146
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,120
I'm so content.

147
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,549
My life has been

148
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,030
worth it!

149
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,120
Great!

150
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:39,720
Great!

151
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,789
Good son!

152
00:08:53,030 --> 00:08:53,840
My son,

153
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:56,240
you'll always be my pride.

154
00:08:59,030 --> 00:09:00,030
Take a rest, Mom.

155
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,270
Today

156
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:17,240
is our big day.

157
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:20,870
It's also a good day.

158
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,910
I also want to share

159
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,380
some of my true feelings with you all.

160
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,390
Mom.

161
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,430
I love you.

162
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,270
Actually, in my mom's heart,

163
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:44,480
I've always been outstanding.

164
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:48,270
She thinks I'm pretty great.

165
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:51,200
Actually, I'm not, Mom.

166
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,830
During the time I was in trouble,

167
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:59,300
I thought about just
throwing in the towel for good.

168
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,630
Really.

169
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,570
Actually, one person appeared

170
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,120
and saved me.

171
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,480
He pulled me back

172
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:12,120
and gave me a second life.

173
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,800
His name is Liu Zhengliang.

174
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:18,240
He is a doctor.

175
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:20,390
I really want to thank him.

176
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,120
And then what?

177
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,730
I was failing again.

178
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:31,750
I was scared again.

179
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,150
I was scared

180
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,030
I couldn't fit into

181
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:36,870
this world.

182
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,600
Another person appeared

183
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,270
and saved me again.

184
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,630
He sold his house

185
00:10:48,030 --> 00:10:49,560
to start a business with me.

186
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,550
He is my best friend,

187
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:55,200
my brother.

188
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,560
His name is Liu Zhengguang.

189
00:10:58,750 --> 00:10:59,680
He's right here.

190
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,310
Sitting in the front row.

191
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:05,370
You're in the center seat.

192
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:10,510
It's your turn.

193
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,770
I don't know what to say.

194
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,600
Finally,

195
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:20,720
I want to thank

196
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,000
the person next to me.

197
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:24,320
Xue.

198
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,630
Speaking of which, well,

199
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,840
isn't my wife beautiful today?

200
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,300
-Beautiful!
-Beautiful!

201
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,150
She's so beautiful!

202
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:38,480
My wife is the most beautiful
in the world!

203
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,020
I fell for her the first time I saw her.

204
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,480
As for me,

205
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,940
I don't have much ability.

206
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:49,030
I talk too much

207
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:50,870
and speak without thinking.

208
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,900
She has never despised me.

209
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,980
When I was at my lowest,

210
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,550
most desperate

211
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,600
and most miserable,

212
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,170
she was the one who pulled me up.

213
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,240
I love you too.

214
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,080
I love you too.

215
00:12:18,510 --> 00:12:19,510
Say a few words.

216
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:20,670
I won't.

217
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:25,870
Okay, I will.

218
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:29,120
Actually, fate is quite wonderful.

219
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:33,790
Sometimes it catches you off guard.

220
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,850
One second everything is fine,

221
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,000
and suddenly, an accident happens.

222
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:45,120
You never know

223
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,780
which will come first,
tomorrow or an accident.

224
00:13:40,710 --> 00:13:42,570
[Ambulance] [120]

225
00:13:42,570 --> 00:13:43,940
[Fucheng Emergency Medical Rescue Center]

226
00:13:55,310 --> 00:13:56,940
[To the Surgical Inpatient Unit,
go down one floor]

227
00:13:56,940 --> 00:13:58,580
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

228
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,590
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

229
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,290
[Operating Department]

230
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,200
Mom, Mom, Mom!

231
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:06,600
Save my mom!

232
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,320
Mom!

233
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,670
Save my mom!

234
00:14:10,970 --> 00:14:13,160
[Keep quiet]

235
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:38,120
Three, two, one, go!

236
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,480
We tried our best,

237
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,000
but we couldn't save her.

238
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:29,630
Mom!

239
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:54,000
Amy.

240
00:16:42,870 --> 00:16:44,470
I used your treatment method

241
00:16:44,790 --> 00:16:45,840
to take a rubber band

242
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,300
and snap myself all night.

243
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:12,829
Go back to sleep.

244
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,550
It's fine. No need.

245
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,579
Don't you have surgery tomorrow?

246
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,600
I work in the funeral business.
I can handle it.

247
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,880
It just hurts a little.

248
00:17:41,350 --> 00:17:42,680
It's all an experience.

249
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,030
Okay.

250
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:56,340
I'll come back tomorrow morning.

251
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:19,330
[24-Hour One-Stop Funeral Services]

252
00:19:04,010 --> 00:19:08,470
[24-Hour One-Stop Funeral Services]

253
00:19:17,570 --> 00:19:24,640
[1314 Funeral Supplies]
[Xiaoximen Store]

254
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,400
See you tomorrow.

255
00:20:18,990 --> 00:20:26,950
[1314 Funeral Supplies]
[Xiaoximen Store]

256
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,420
Why haven't you gone back?

257
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:33,160
It's nice here.

258
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,700
I can keep you company.

259
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,690
I want to go to the hospital.

260
00:20:48,750 --> 00:20:50,750
Why do you want to go to the hospital?

261
00:20:50,750 --> 00:20:52,010
To keep my mom company.

262
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,240
If the funeral home wasn't full,

263
00:21:06,510 --> 00:21:07,240
I wouldn't have left her

264
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,510
there all alone.

265
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:13,630
I want to go and stay with her.

266
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:16,830
Okay. I'll go with you.

267
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:32,290
[Uphold Medical Ethics,
Build a Model Hospital]

268
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:30,880
Wait for me.

269
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:35,910
[Emergency Item Storage]

270
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:34,830
Li.

271
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:36,030
Chief Physician Liu.

272
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:37,510
I need to go downstairs.

273
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:39,510
Can you unlock the stairwell for me?

274
00:21:40,110 --> 00:21:41,110
According to the rules,

275
00:21:41,110 --> 00:21:41,680
at this time,

276
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:42,960
you are not allowed to go down,

277
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:43,550
unless—

278
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:44,640
I know. I know.

279
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,400
We won't go into the morgue.

280
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,200
We'll just sit at the door for a while.

281
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:49,000
It's so late at night.

282
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:49,960
Even if you don't go in,

283
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:50,750
that place is—

284
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:53,000
Can you just do me a favor?

285
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,960
Okay.

286
00:21:56,830 --> 00:22:04,720
[Security Duty Room]

287
00:21:57,790 --> 00:21:58,480
Thank you.

288
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,280
It's nothing.

289
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,160
I still can't believe

290
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,000
this is real.

291
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,000
Once you go in

292
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,200
this door,

293
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,750
you can never come out.

294
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:30,270
Say something.

295
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:33,240
I thought you

296
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,750
