300
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:45,750
Just say anything.

301
00:22:47,830 --> 00:22:49,960
Help me distract myself.

302
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,640
Let me tell you a secret.

303
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,960
The truth is, I studied medicine

304
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,560
