305
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,600
Doctors live longer?

306
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:15,400
I don't think so.

307
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,750
This job is way too demanding, after all.

308
00:23:17,750 --> 00:23:20,210
I'd be grateful
if it didn't shorten my life.

309
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:23,920
So it's to overcome the fear.

310
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,100
Probably not that either.

311
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,270
I used to think I could,

312
00:23:30,310 --> 00:23:31,170
but I couldn't.

313
00:23:33,550 --> 00:23:35,550
But later, after my mom passed away,

314
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,320
I wasn't afraid anymore.

315
00:23:39,310 --> 00:23:40,590
They say parents

316
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,440
