320
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:52,110
I didn't think about it at first.

321
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:54,680
Later, after we got together,

322
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:57,200
that feeling came back.

323
00:23:58,200 --> 00:24:00,260
I seem to understand a little bit now.

324
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,160
I was afraid...

325
00:24:04,750 --> 00:24:06,110
I was afraid that others would be sad

326
00:24:06,110 --> 00:24:08,170
and heartbroken because of my death.

327
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:11,010
So after my mom passed away,

328
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:13,280
I wasn't afraid anymore.

329
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:14,880
So,

330
00:24:15,790 --> 00:24:16,750
