I've got a small office there,

579
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:07,550
but the factory is still in Dayushu.

580
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:08,800
Remember,

581
00:40:10,150 --> 00:40:11,920
this is our home turf.

582
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,920
Whenever you want to come back,

583
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,520
come back and visit anytime.

584
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,580
Let me think about it, Junnan.

585
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:23,550
Okay.

586
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,050
I'm leaving.

587
00:40:28,360 --> 00:40:32,160
[Xinguang Script Roleplay Club]

588
00:40:33,670 --> 00:40:34,600
Thanks, Junnan.

589
00:40:45,710 --> 00:40:46,920
Morning, Chief Physician Liu.

590
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:47,450
Morning.

591
00:40:58,480 --> 00:40:59,280
You scared me.

592
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:00,690
Why are you here?

593
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:03,110
I'm not sure about something,

594
00:41:03,110 --> 00:41:04,840
so I wanted to ask your opinion.

595
00:41:05,590 --> 00:41:07,450
Why does everyone ask my opinion?

596
00:41:08,190 --> 00:41:09,190
Besides examining brains,

597
00:41:09,190 --> 00:41:10,150
I don't know anything else.

598
00:41:10,150 --> 00:41:11,190
I have no opinion.

599
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:12,590
Two heads

600
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,840
are better than one.

601
00:41:13,840 --> 00:41:17,100
I'm not asking you
to take responsibility for your advice.

602
00:41:17,150 --> 00:41:18,400
Okay, tell me.

603
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:19,710
What is it?

604
00:41:21,230 --> 00:41:23,280
Do you think my business will succeed?

605
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:25,030
I really don't know anything
about business.

606
00:41:25,030 --> 00:41:26,560
I can't give you any advice.

607
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:28,880
Just tell me your intuition.

608
00:41:33,230 --> 00:41:33,960
It's hard to say.

609
00:41:33,960 --> 00:41:36,280
So it's a 50% chance of making money

610
00:41:36,320 --> 00:41:37,590
and a 50% chance of losing money,

611
00:41:37,590 --> 00:41:38,280
right?

612
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:44,280
Zhengguang,

613
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:46,420
you're only in your twenties.

614
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:48,650
You don't need to overthink it.

615
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:51,850
You should try more things
when you're young.

616
00:41:52,110 --> 00:41:53,400
The experience

617
00:41:53,550 --> 00:41:54,760
is what matters most.

618
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:59,650
I don't have the capital to make mistakes.

619
00:42:00,070 --> 00:42:01,280
I don't have any savings either,

620
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:03,140
but I'm doing just fine, aren't I?

621
00:42:03,190 --> 00:42:04,250
That's different.

622
00:42:04,670 --> 00:42:05,800
You have professional skills,

623
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:07,110
and you're very good at them.

624
00:42:07,110 --> 00:42:08,190
Even if you only had
a pair of underwear left,

625
00:42:08,190 --> 00:42:09,390
you wouldn't starve.

626
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,280
Stop agonizing over it.

627
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:12,880
You've invested all your money.

628
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:14,010
Do you have a choice?

629
00:42:18,190 --> 00:42:19,030
Junnan said

630
00:42:19,190 --> 00:42:20,590
he wanted me to give
the escape room to Jia Xin

631
00:42:20,590 --> 00:42:21,590
and work with him.

632
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,030
That's fine.

633
00:42:24,030 --> 00:42:25,230
It's another option.

634
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:27,000
But the key is,

635
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:28,930
you need to know what he wants to do.

636
00:42:30,190 --> 00:42:31,280
He seemed to say

637
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:33,110
he wants to open the company in Beijing.

638
00:42:33,110 --> 00:42:34,760
He can't put down roots
in Beijing, can he?

639
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:35,890
Isn't that perfect?

640
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:37,840
Haven't you repeatedly said

641
00:42:37,840 --> 00:42:40,240
you want to develop
your career in Beijing?

642
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,660
I haven't thought it through.

643
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:45,960
Well, Beijing

644
00:42:46,510 --> 00:42:47,370
is pretty good.

645
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:49,320
My hometown is also pretty good.

646
00:42:49,320 --> 00:42:50,800
But Beijing has its problems,

647
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,860
and my hometown has its problems too.

648
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:55,150
I'm talking a lot of nonsense.

649
00:42:55,150 --> 00:42:56,410
Do you know what I mean?

650
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,230
I do.

651
00:42:58,670 --> 00:42:59,480
No, you don't.

652
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:00,960
Stop humoring me.

653
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:01,670
You said it yourself.

654
00:43:01,670 --> 00:43:03,030
You don't know anything
except treating patients.

655
00:43:03,030 --> 00:43:04,630
I really do understand this.

656
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:08,800
I'll take you somewhere after work.

657
00:43:10,030 --> 00:43:10,840
Where?

658
00:43:11,190 --> 00:43:12,480
You'll know when we get there.
